{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05298","headline":"梁王宅侍宴应制同用风字 · 韦安石","name":"梁王宅侍宴应制同用风字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梁园开胜景，轩驾动宸衷。\n早荷承湛露，修竹引薰风。\n九酝倾锺石，百兽协丝桐。\n小臣陪宴镐，献寿奉维嵩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦安石","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}